        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[codes, standards]",
        "section": "plumbing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Codes and Standards",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AHJ PRIMACY:\n    The AHJ (Authority Having Jurisdiction) = local building department\n    Their interpretation of the code is final\n    Code sections can be ambiguous; inspector's interpretation controls\n    Best practice: call the local plumbing inspector BEFORE starting\n    work on anything non-routine. \"Is X acceptable?\" costs nothing;\n    rework after failed inspection costs time and money.\n```"
    },
