      "text": "```\n  WHY PERMITS EXIST:\n    Life-safety: trap seals, vent systems, gas pressure testing,\n    T&P relief valves — failures kill people\n    Insurance: work done without permit may void homeowner's insurance\n    Resale: un-permitted work = disclosure issue; can require demolition\n    Code documentation: future owners know how it was built"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-CODES-STANDARDS.md#017",
      "path": [
        "09-CODES-STANDARDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
