        "section": "plumbing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Codes and Standards",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHEN PERMITS ARE REQUIRED (varies by jurisdiction):\n    Generally required: new construction, new fixtures, water heater\n    replacement, gas additions, sewer lateral work, re-piping\n    Generally not required (varies): like-for-like fixture replacement\n    (same faucet, same toilet), minor repairs, unclogging drains\n    Rule of thumb: if you're opening walls, adding new pipes,\n    or changing system capacity → permit likely required"
    },
