      "text": "PIPE SIZING:\n    From available pressure at source (PSI)\n    Subtract: meter loss, vertical rise (0.43 PSI/ft), pipe friction\n    → Residual pressure at design fixture\n    Must maintain ≥15 PSI at any fixture during peak flow"
